rnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/09/constellation-energy-ceg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,0,1,1.13],"tariffs":[1,0,1,1.13],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.1046,"r5":0.121,"r1_spy":0.0809,"r5_spy":0.0951,"r1_sector":0.0893,"r5_sector":0.0999,"etf":"XLU"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"CEG 2022 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2022-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Eggers","x":"We reiterated our guidance comfortably for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2022 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2022-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Dominguez","x":"We knew, look, we knew walking into those call folks, we're looking for us to probably increase guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2023 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2023-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kathleen Barron","x":"There was an extension of Price-Anderson by 20 years, streamlining of NRC review of new reactors and additional funding for domestic sources of fuel.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2023 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2023-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Dominguez","x":"As a result of this continued strong performance, we are again raising our full year guidance range to $3.8 billion to $4 billion.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2023 Q4","e":"ceg","d":"2024-02-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"Boston Consulting Group believes that AI and regular data center demand will grow by 7% to 7% of total electricity demand by 2030.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2023 Q4","e":"ceg","d":"2024-02-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"…going to be focused on 2024 guidance and Constellation's future, I want to start out by commenting on the outstanding year we had in 2023, where we materially raised guidance in both the second and third quarter calls and yet still managed to exceed the top of the range in our full-year results.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2024-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Eggers","x":"For units that were already above the PTC floor, the full offside of the capacity price increase will be realized.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2024-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"In this quarter, we're able to provide excellent results, but also raise guidance in just the second quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2024-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"But we know this; colocation in competitive markets remains one of the best ways for the U.S. to quickly build the large data centers that are necessary to lead on AI.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2024-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"We have some ideas about how we will do that in accordance with the existing tariffs that allow us to get to the end state fairly quickly.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2024-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Shar Pourreza","x":"And then just the pathways to getting FRCC, some clarity on BTM tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2024-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"PJM should also proceed with streamlining the process for adding generation like our Crane restart.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2024 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2024-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"Today, Dan and I once again have the privilege to share their results, results that outperform our plan, your expectations and require us to raise guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2025 Q1","e":"ceg","d":"2025-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"They are making these investments because AI is delivering for customers, and you can see it in their business results.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2025 Q1","e":"ceg","d":"2025-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"…that, unlike hypothetical new assets that face an uncertain world of interconnection queues, tariffs, supply chain issues, and delivery dates that are sometimes years away, having a fleet of new plants that are up and running exceptionally well with a good team running them might offset a…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2025 Q1","e":"ceg","d":"2025-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"And that's even without the tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CEG 2026 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"You've read the Morgan Stanley report the other day, the returns for the investments they're making in data economy and these AI models are proving out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/constellation-energy-ceg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CEG 2026 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"FERC ordered every RTO to justify how their existing tariffs provide for the just and reasonable interconnection of large loads to the grid or propose revisions to their tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/constellation-energy-ceg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CEG 2026 Q2","e":"ceg","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"On a parallel path with the PJM and FERC processes, Constellation and other stakeholders are urging EPA to make clear that any curtailments ultimately directed by FERC tariffs should be excluded from the 50-hour annual limit for the use of backup generators at data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/constellation-energy-ceg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CEG 2026 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2026-11-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"James West","x":"And then as you think about the recent elections, one of the biggest impacts, I think, is bringing labor to the table and making sure labor is appropriately compensated when we think about data centers and the AI build-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/09/constellation-energy-ceg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CEG 2026 Q3","e":"ceg","d":"2026-11-09","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Joseph Dominguez","x":"So I expect that the RTOs will follow FERC's guidance there and include those opportunities in their tariffs, and we'll be participating and making sure that, that happens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/09/constellation-energy-ceg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[49,1,4400,0,0,0,1055,3099],[50,1,3039,0,0,0,2008,729],[51,1,8760,0,0,0,7763,662],[52,1,9133,0,0,0,8194,714],[53,1,5223,0,0,0,4353,492],[54,1,6967,0,0,0,2981,3694],[55,1,7244,0,0,0,2874,4037],[56,1,12406,0,0,0,11377,679],[57,1,2727,0,0,0,1905,590],[5